      "role": "spoken",
      "adoption": "Verbatim field and original order; bounded ACT6 adoption after stable ACT5."
    },
    {
      "id": "text_rc1_0054",
      "value": "다음번에는 조금 달라지겠죠.",
      "sourceText": "다음번에는 조금 달라지겠죠.",
      "sourceId": "SRC-RC1-0054",
